The BIDS loader gives `condition` (the event name) and `task` along `obs`, as the embedding loader does, and both take `representation="recording"` (`BIDSConfig`, `BIDSDataset`): one row per recording and condition, the mean of its rows, named `<recording_id>_cond-<condition>`, computed by the new `aggregate_recordings`. Subject metadata columns may no longer be named `task`, `condition` or `epoch_count`.
